  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">太阳与月亮圆形版</strong></span></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>中文</strong></span></h2><p><strong>🌙☀️ 太阳与月亮圆形版将Minecraft的天空改头换面，用完美的圆形替代了经典的太阳和月亮。这款纹理包提供了更简洁、更现代的外观，在保持游戏原有风格的同时，增添了更精致的视觉细节。</strong></p><p><strong>✨ 完美适合那些希望在游戏中拥有更简单、更美观、更自然天空的玩家。</strong></p><p><strong>1.21 BETA 版本</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙语</strong></span></h2><div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span>🌙☀️ </span><span>太阳</span><span>与</span><span>月亮</span><span>圆形版</span> <span>将</span><span>Minecraft</span><span>的</span><span>天空</span><span>改头换面，</span><span>用</span><span>完美</span><span>的</span><span>圆形</span><span>替换了</span><span>经典</span><span>的</span><span>太阳</span><span>和</span><span>月亮</span><span>。</span><span>这款</span><span>纹理包</span><span>提供</span><span>了</span><span>更</span><span>简洁</span><span>、</span><span>更</span><span>现代</span><span>的</span><span>外观，</span><span>在</span><span>保持</span><span>游戏</span><span>原有</span><span>风格</span><span>的</span><span>同时，</span><span>增添</span><span>了</span><span>更</span><span>精致</span><span>的</span><span>视觉</span><span>细节。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>✨ </span><span>完美</span><span>适合</span><span>那些</span><span>希望</span><span>在</span><span>游戏</span><span>中</span><span>拥有</span><span>更</span><span>简单</span><span>、</span><span>更</span><span>美观</span><span>、</span><span>更</span><span>自然</span><span>天空</span><span>的</span><span>玩家。</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5db302.png\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"205\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a7-a0a9-5c2642f644cb.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ddediegod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube频道\" width=\"207\" height=\"60\"></a></strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f%253frefid%253d871639\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_163a7545-bbf3-47c9-817b-4423c2d5688d.png\" width=\"204\" height=\"60\"></a> &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fd_de_diego_d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_99fae7f1-37c6-4d3f-9c4d-e13116617f73.png\" width=\"204\" height=\"60\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://me